<div class="panel-heading">
<h3 class="panel-title"><span class="mw-headline" id="Losowy_przedmiot">Losowy przedmiot</span></h3>
</div>
<div class="panel-body"><p><div class="panel panel-primary">
<div class="panel-body">
<div class="bs-docs-section">
