<tr>
<td width="20%" style="width: 10%; text-align: right"><a href="/wiki/Plik:Bat_Decoration.gif" class="image"><img alt="Bat Decoration.gif" src="data:image/png;base64," /></a></td>
<td><span style="font-size: 160%">Bat Decoration</span><br /><span style="font-style: italic"></span></td>
</tr><tr>
<td valign="top" style="text-align: right"><b>Waga:</b></td>
<td colspan="2">2.00 <a href="/wiki/Oz" title="Oz">oz</a>.</td>
