<td colspan="2" style="font-size:0.8em"><a href="/wiki/Dark_Torturer" title="Dark Torturer">Dark Torturer</a>, <a href="/wiki/Mr._Punish" title="Mr. Punish">Mr. Punish</a>, <a href="/wiki/The_Mutated_Pumpkin" title="The Mutated Pumpkin">The Mutated Pumpkin</a>
</td>
</tr><tr>
<td colspan="2" width="10%" valign="top" style="text-align: left; padding-top: 0.5em"><span style="font-size: 80%"><b><a href="/wiki/Bat_Decoration" title="Bat Decoration">Więcej o Bat Decoration</a>.</b></span></td>
<td colspan="2">
</td>
</tr>
